package-lock.json

# Prettier hardcodes *-emphasis -> _emphasis_ in markdown with no config
# escape hatch; the project docs use *italic* throughout, so exclude
# markdown from formatting rather than fight it on every `format` run.
*.md

# Hand-authored invoice-template Handlebars layouts + the hand-written default
# generated output are byte-frozen (Inv #44; bm50 seeds them, bm55 parity-checks
# them against the generator). Prettier's glimmer parser reflows their inline
# text, which breaks rendered-text assertions and would make the
# generator-parity check impossible — never let it touch them.
*.hbs

# The whole invoice-template seed tree is byte-frozen: bm50 commits a SHA-256
# `checksums.json` per version directory, and load() re-derives it on every
# render (Inv #44/#45). Prettier reflowing any JSON/manifest/sample/csv-map
# here would silently break those digests — exclude the entire tree.
db/seeds/invoice-templates/
